{"id":"652297","name":"黑全麦发糕","author":"清水淡竹","authorId":"8451954","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/652297/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黑全麦粉","amount":"200g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"2g"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"160g"}],"sub":[{"name":"白糖","amount":"10g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"黑全麦粉、白糖、酵母混合。","img":"images/652297/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"红枣洗去去核切小粒，鸡蛋、牛奶备用。","img":"images/652297/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡蛋打入黑全麦粉中。","img":"images/652297/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加牛奶。","img":"images/652297/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"拌匀，放入红枣。","img":"images/652297/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅拌均匀，盖保鲜膜放温暖处发酵。","img":"images/652297/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"发酵好的面糊。","img":"images/652297/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"用筷子搅拌排气。","img":"images/652297/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放到纸杯中二次发酵。","img":"images/652297/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"撒上芝麻，放到笼屉中冷水上锅蒸，水开上汽后15分钟。","img":"images/652297/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"关火，虚蒸5分钟开盖。","img":"images/652297/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"枣香、麦香、芝麻香。","img":"images/652297/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"发糕喧软，越嚼越有味。","img":"images/652297/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}